design-rails NOTICE

This project is first-party original work. Three IDEAS (not code) are adapted
from open-source projects, with thanks:

- plugin87/ux-ui-agent-skills (MIT): the raw-palette-utility detector concept,
  token-context awareness (a value reached through var()/theme() is not a
  hardcode), and the unresolved-token detector concept.
- pbakaus/impeccable (Apache-2.0): the roles-not-swatches method and the
  rule-of-3 for token promotion.
- murphytrueman/design-system-ops (MIT): the primitive/semantic/component
  DTCG tier architecture.

Output format targets the DESIGN.md specification by Google (google-labs-code/
design.md, Apache-2.0); this project bundles none of its code.
